sentences.l:
It, then, in the hall the maidservants and the lady mother
with their hands were handling and with their eyes were looking at,
a price offering;

They then to the council-seat went forth, and to the people’s talk,
and she quickly three goblets having hidden under her bosom
carried out;

but I was left behind, grieved in heart;
And them to Ithaca brought near, carrying them, wind and water,
where me Laertes bought with his own possessions.

and they, on the dry land,
Telemachus’ companions, loosed the sails, and down took the mast
quickly, and her into the anchorage pulled forward with oars;

but for you yourself
it is worse, since I indeed shall be away, and not you my mother
will see;

But to you another man I point out, whom you might come to,
Eurymachus, wise-minded Polybus’ splendid son,
whom now equal to a god the Ithacans regard;

And Telemachus under his feet bound on fair sandals,
and took up a sturdy spear, pointed with sharp bronze,
from the ship’s deck;
